1929
02:00:20,320 --> 02:00:32,300
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito pong performance-based regulation ay isang forward-looking na methodology unlike RORB na nakabase sa historical cost or historical test here.

1930
