ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po yung mga building blocks.

1936
02:00:56,860 --> 02:01:07,100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: OPEX, return on rate base, return off rate base, at saka yung other taxes.

1937
