ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po yung forecast na base doon sa efficient operating expenses,

1939
02:01:17,100 --> 02:01:26,440
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at saka yung rate base niya, yung nakalipas na ng mga na-procure niya na assets,

1940
