ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: individual na mga consumers mayroon ng kapabilidad na makapag-generate din para sa sarili nilang pangangailangan at makapagbenta rin, makapag-export.

5092
04:32:45,000 --> 04:32:52,020
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya patuloy din po yung ginagawa nating pag-aaral kung ano ang dapat baguhin doon sa regulatory framework.

5093
04:32:52,120 --> 04:32:57,780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nabanggit ko nga po yung tungkol doon sa paniningil ng distribution charge ng distribution utilities.

5094
04:32:57,780 --> 04:33:01,780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Maaring magkaroon nito ng impact dahil habang dumadami yung mayroong mga...

5095
04:33:02,660 --> 04:33:09,340
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: generation facilities, nababawasan ng kilowatt-hour sales ang benta nung ating mga distribution utilities.

5096
04:33:09,660 --> 04:33:22,100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At kaya kung ang kanilang revenue ay nakabase sa per kilowatt-hour, maaring mabawasan nito at magkakaroon sila ng mga stranded assets na kanilang pinut-up.

5097
04:33:22,100 --> 04:33:30,080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nag-tayo sila ng mga linya ng ganitong kalalaking mga kapasidad pero dahil nagkaroon ng mga pagbabago,

5098
04:33:30,180 --> 04:33:32,100
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kompleksyon doon sa ating...

5099
04:33:32,660 --> 04:33:43,780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: energy landscape at nagkaroon ng mas maraming distributed energy resources ay kinakailangan talaga ng pagbabago doon sa regulatory framework.

5100
04:33:43,780 --> 04:33:49,720
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kasama na din po dyan yung pagre-rebisa bukod doon sa Philippine Green Code at yung distribution code.

5101
04:33:50,160 --> 04:33:58,940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung mga pagre-rebisa ng mga interconnection technical standards, pagkakaroon din po ng regulatory framework pagdating sa battery.

5102
04:33:59,540 --> 04:34:02,420
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya ito po ay tuloy-tuloy na pag-aaral.

5103
04:34:02,660 --> 04:34:13,020
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya dapat tayo na tumigil lang at manatili doon sa nakagawian nung 10, 20, 30 years ago dahil nagbabago din po talaga ang landscape.

5104
04:34:13,700 --> 04:34:14,340
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Salamat po.

5105
04:34:14,340 --> 04:34:30,340
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So may technical study na po ba ang DOE o ERC hingginit sa net metering sa technical losses ng isang kooperatiba o ng isang distribution utility?

5106
04:34:35,600 --> 04:34:36,320
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Sa ngayon po.

5107
04:34:36,720 --> 04:34:47,760
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Hindi po po namin na-quantify kung mayroon talagang impact dahil we operated on the assumption that since itong mga export na ito will be consumed in the same area,

5108
04:34:48,320 --> 04:35:06,260
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: datawid lang doon sa kapitbahay at hindi na masyadong magiging malaki ang dadaanan, maliit lang or if not, wala pa nga or positive pa ang impact dahil sa inbis na yung kuryente manggaling sa mas malayong lugar para supplyan.

5109
04:35:06,720 --> 04:35:17,780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung kapitbahay nung isang customer na naka net meter, yung kuryente yung ginamit niya ay nanggaling na lang doon sa kapitbahay na mayroong sobra or may export.

5110
04:35:17,780 --> 04:35:37,380
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kung dudumihan ko o isip ko, kung ako ay ang 10 kilowatt ang kailangan ng aking bahay, kung gawin kong 25 dahil naging distribution utility na ako.

5111
04:35:45,830 --> 04:35:46,070
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung...

5112
04:35:46,930 --> 04:36:04,030
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kakayanin po nung inyong bubong, yung kapasidad na 25 kilowatt, samantalang ang inyong demand ay talagang masiservisohan lang ng 10 kilowatt, magdidepende na po yan kung ito ay naka net meter, magdidepende po nga yun yan doon sa pricing methodology.

5113
04:36:04,470 --> 04:36:14,670
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ngayon, ang umiiral na pricing methodology, yung bayad sa iyo sa export mo ay equivalent doon sa average generation charge ng distribution utility.

5114
04:36:14,670 --> 04:36:15,830
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, kung ang...

5115
04:36:15,830 --> 04:36:38,950
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung pagtatayo naman nung iyong kapasidad na 20 kilowatt, on a per kilowatt hour basis, mas mababa kaysa dyan sa pricing na lalabas based on that pricing methodology, maaring hindi siya economical na mag-put up ng kapasidad higher than your own requirement.

5116
04:36:38,950 --> 04:36:45,810
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: But, kung like nakikita natin ngayon, pataas din ang trend ng generation charge.

5117
04:36:45,830 --> 04:37:01,210
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At pababa naman, ang pababa yung per kilowatt na cost ng pagtatayo ng solar, maaring ang makainggan yan ng mayroong magtatayo ng kapasidad higit doon sa kanilang pangangailangan.

5118
04:37:01,210 --> 04:37:09,870
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At sa puntong ito, ang question is, mayroon pang question on the stranded contract cost ng distribution utility.

5119
04:37:10,290 --> 04:37:15,730
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dahil maaaring kumontrata ang distribution utility ng katamtaman lang.

5120
04:37:15,830 --> 04:37:27,750
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Para doon sa pangangailangan ng captive customer niya, at dahil nga mayroon siyang mga customer na nagsipag tayo ng kanilang self-generation facility at mayroon pang benta, mayroon pang export,

5121
04:37:28,490 --> 04:37:38,010
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: baka mga hulugan nito na magkakaroon siya ng mga kontratang pinasok na hindi naman niya magamit dahil kailangan unahin yung export ng net metering customer.

5122
04:37:38,010 --> 04:37:45,810
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, kakailangan din talaga tingnan yung implementasyon, yung current implementation ng net metering.

5123
04:37:45,830 --> 04:37:55,610
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung hindi na yun makaka-apekto doon naman sa mga kontratang pinasok ng distribution utility para sa pagsisilbi sa kanyang captive customers.

5124
04:37:55,610 --> 04:38:13,470
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At ang isang pamamaraan dito ay kung ibubuksan yung net metering, hindi lang doon sa distribution utility, kumbaga, hindi lang yung distribution utility ang mamanduhan na bumili o kumuha noong kuryenting yun,

5125
04:38:13,470 --> 04:38:25,450
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: kundi maaaring iba ring end user o retail electricity supplier ang kukuha o mag-a-aggregate nitong export na ito at ibibenta naman niya sa kanyang customer,

5126
04:38:25,990 --> 04:38:32,170
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: be it the captive customer or be it the contestable customer or for its own use.

5127
04:38:32,170 --> 04:38:42,050
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, tagal po nyo sa pagsisilbi. Bata pa po kayo, nakilala ko na po kayo, Chairman Juan.

5128
04:38:43,470 --> 04:38:57,080
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Meron po kayong sulat, System Loss Performance of Distribution Utilities, dated August 26, 2026.

5129
04:38:57,080 --> 04:39:07,110
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, pinag-aaralan ko po ito at tinitinan ko.

5130
04:39:07,970 --> 04:39:15,790
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kanina pa po pinag-uusapan, technical loss, dalawa yan, kasi hindi po maintindihan ng masang Pilipino.

5131
04:39:16,630 --> 04:39:20,310
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ano ba talaga? Kasi napakaraming charges na nakalagay.

5132
04:39:20,350 --> 04:39:25,470
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Buhat nung iyan, bundle natin yung rate. Yun po ang malaking problema eh.

5133
04:39:26,170 --> 04:39:31,870
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kaya minumura po lahat ng DEU at saka ng kooperatiba.

5134
04:39:34,170 --> 04:39:43,010
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, hindi umalaman ng tao kung saan, kung bakit ganito kalaki.

5135
04:39:43,670 --> 04:39:45,970
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Samantalang generation cost ganito.

5136
04:39:45,970 --> 04:39:49,970
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang generation cost po ba ay merong system.

5137
04:39:50,350 --> 04:39:50,930
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: System loss.

5138
04:39:54,820 --> 04:40:04,580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yun pong malalaki, yung generating corporation, naka-embed na po dyan yung cost ng transmission loss

5139
04:40:04,580 --> 04:40:12,460
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: na nai-incur sa pagsusupply mula sa generation plants na nakakonekta sa transmission

5140
04:40:12,460 --> 04:40:15,840
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: papunta doon sa kanilang distribution utilities.

5141
04:40:15,840 --> 04:40:22,020
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, ang bayaran nila, yung presyohan yan, inclusive na doon sa cost ng transmission loss.

5142
04:40:22,960 --> 04:40:23,260
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So,

5143
04:40:23,680 --> 04:40:31,300
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: lahat po lumalabas, hindi lang utility, hindi lang Meralco, hindi lang kooperatiba,

5144
04:40:31,960 --> 04:40:39,320
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: hindi lang yung malalaking privado o kaya kooperatiba, ang may system loss charge.

5145
04:40:41,910 --> 04:40:47,170
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Opo, nag-i-incur ng transmission na system loss at may cost yan.

5146
04:40:47,170 --> 04:40:50,830
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Mayroon din sa distribution level, may cost yan.

5147
04:40:51,010 --> 04:40:54,890
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At ang recovery, pagdating sa distribution level na system loss,

5148
04:40:55,150 --> 04:40:58,870
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ito ay naka-reflect doon sa system loss charge.

5149
04:40:59,190 --> 04:41:04,230
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dati, bago nung nag-unbundling, ito ay nagsisingil na rin.

5150
04:41:04,510 --> 04:41:10,050
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya lang, ito ay nakapasok naman doon sa power purchase adjustment, yung PPA,

5151
04:41:10,330 --> 04:41:13,430
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: noong bago tayo nagkaroon ng IPIRA at ng unbundling.

5152
04:41:17,340 --> 04:41:18,140
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Tama po.

5153
04:41:18,880 --> 04:41:21,680
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kaya nga, hindi mo maaintindihan ang masang Pilipino.

5154
04:41:22,440 --> 04:41:24,860
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, kailangan po kasi,

5155
04:41:25,420 --> 04:41:28,220
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: si Katari Karin,

5156
04:41:28,420 --> 04:41:30,640
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: at saka sa ERC po,

5157
04:41:31,100 --> 04:41:39,440
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: kailangan po talaga ng efektibong komunikasyon sa madlang Pilipino.

5158
04:41:39,980 --> 04:41:40,900
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Masang Pilipino.

5159
04:41:41,940 --> 04:41:43,640
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Na ito po ang problema.

5160
04:41:45,640 --> 04:41:48,120
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ito yung charges, ito lang.

5161
04:41:50,260 --> 04:41:55,340
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kesa yung napakarami pong charges sa isang bill na natatarantay tao,

5162
04:41:55,900 --> 04:41:57,700
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: hindi nila maalaman.

5163
04:41:58,700 --> 04:41:59,360
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Yes, sir.

5164
04:41:59,660 --> 04:42:05,700
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: At, Mr. Chair, we'll work with the ERC on the reformatting of the bill

5165
04:42:05,700 --> 04:42:08,160
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: para mas madaling maintindihan, sir.

5166
04:42:08,280 --> 04:42:09,980
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: We'll work on it.

5167
04:42:10,080 --> 04:42:10,720
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

5168
04:42:11,460 --> 04:42:11,940
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So,

5169
04:42:13,040 --> 04:42:21,840
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: hindi na po akong masasalta dahil maliwanag naman po na.

5170
04:42:22,360 --> 04:42:28,500
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At, alam ko pong capable ang ating sekretary at saka yung ating ERC Chair.

5171
04:42:28,500 --> 04:42:28,580
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

5172
04:42:29,660 --> 04:42:30,600
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Maraming salamat po sa inyo.

5173
04:42:31,720 --> 04:42:34,640
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Thank you, Representative Vergara.

5174
04:42:34,920 --> 04:42:38,480
Rep. Ed Christopher S. Go: Now, we move to the recognize Sarah Elago

5175
04:42:38,620 --> 04:42:42,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

5176
04:42:43,280 --> 04:42:47,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para po sa ERC, batay sa inyong ulat as of mid-August,

5177
04:42:47,660 --> 04:42:54,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may nasa 5,380 consumer complaints ng naisampas sa ERC ngayong taon.

5178
04:42:54,160 --> 04:42:59,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mas malaki po ito kumpara sa 5,329 complaints noong 2025,

5179
04:42:59,960 --> 04:43:00,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at 3,220 complaints.

5180
04:43:01,040 --> 04:43:03,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 189 naman noong 2024.

5181
04:43:03,840 --> 04:43:05,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Higit 4,000 naman po dito,

5182
04:43:06,200 --> 04:43:09,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o 77% ng complaints ngayong taon.

5183
04:43:09,740 --> 04:43:12,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nangangalahati pa lang po tayo ngayong 2026

5184
04:43:12,220 --> 04:43:17,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at tungkol po sa issue o concern na kaugnay sa serbisyo ko ng Meralco.

5185
04:43:18,320 --> 04:43:21,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano na pong status ng mga complaints na ito?

5186
04:43:21,920 --> 04:43:27,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May na-penalize na po ba ang ERC na electric power industry participant?

5187
04:43:27,520 --> 04:43:30,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron, nakabatay po ito sa anong grounds?

5188
04:43:31,040 --> 04:43:38,280
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Una po, lilinawin lang namin yung aming kategorya ng consumer complaints.

5189
04:43:38,740 --> 04:43:41,860
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Dalawang klase po kasi ang tinuturing naming complaints.

5190
04:43:42,080 --> 04:43:51,020
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: One, yung informal na naisasampas sa amin sa pamamagitan ng email, walk-in, letter, o referral.

5191
04:43:51,900 --> 04:43:56,260
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito pong mga ganitong nature ng complaints,

5192
04:43:56,420 --> 04:43:59,040
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: bago po siya talaga maging formal na complaint,

5193
04:43:59,040 --> 04:44:02,040
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ang aming ginagawa ay namamagdala.

5194
04:44:02,480 --> 04:44:06,420
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pagitan kami between that consumer and the utility.

5195
04:44:07,080 --> 04:44:13,420
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nang sa ganon ay kung magkakaroon ng solusyon or dispute resolution,

5196
04:44:14,200 --> 04:44:17,940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay magagawa nila at their level.

5197
04:44:18,280 --> 04:44:25,640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, ang karaniwan po na nakakarating sa amin ganitong sumbong reklamo

5198
04:44:25,640 --> 04:44:27,500
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: ay may kinalaman doon sa bill.

5199
04:44:28,000 --> 04:44:32,460
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Meron po na nagkukwestyon doon sa kanilang natanggap.

5200
04:44:32,480 --> 04:44:43,480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At mayroon din naman po ng mga instances na lumalapit sumusulat sa amin.

5201
04:44:44,000 --> 04:44:49,980
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ang kadahilanan naman ay mayroong naging inspeksyon ang utility, ang Meralco,

5202
04:44:50,420 --> 04:44:58,160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: at sila ay nakitaan daw ng badges ng mayroong problema doon sa metro.

5203
04:44:58,160 --> 04:45:00,160
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya hinatak yung metro.

5204
04:45:00,000 --> 04:45:03,840
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At ngayon ay sinisingil sila ng differential billing na malaki.

5205
04:45:04,360 --> 04:45:09,480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So, sumusulat sila sa amin, pinagbibigay alam na ganito yung sitwasyon nila.

5206
04:45:10,580 --> 04:45:17,140
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pagka ganito pong instances, pinapatawag namin o sinusulatan namin ang utility upang magkomento.

5207
04:45:17,600 --> 04:45:28,180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At nakakaroon ng mga conciliation hearings or conferences between the consumer complainant and the utility representative.

5208
04:45:28,180 --> 04:45:45,180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung wala pong maging resolusyon doon sa kanila pong reklamo, amin pong ina-advise sila na gawing formal na yung complaint sa pamamagitan ng pagpa-file ng formal complaint.

5209
04:45:46,120 --> 04:45:51,440
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: This is a verified complaint, kaparehan ng mga complaint na ipina-file sa mga regular courts.

5210
04:45:51,900 --> 04:45:57,360
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero ginagamitan po namin ito ng summary procedure, nang sa ganun mabilis lang din po.

5211
04:45:57,360 --> 04:46:14,140
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kapag na ito na po ay na-transform into a formal complaint, ang turing na po namin dito ay isang proceeding na nangangailangan ng pag-exercise ng quasi-judicial jurisdiction or authority ng ERC.

5212
04:46:14,140 --> 04:46:25,080
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kaya sa pagdating sa ganitong proceeding, magkakaroon ng pre-trial conference, tapos presentation of evidence through judicial affidavits,

5213
04:46:25,180 --> 04:46:27,340
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: o pamisan, nakakaroon din ng formal trial.

5214
04:46:27,360 --> 04:46:51,780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Doon po sa dami ng 5,000, [unclear]. Sa ngayon po, as of the latest, ang ongoing po na consumer complaint namin sa pagdating sa Meralco ay nasa 3,657 na.

5215
04:46:51,780 --> 04:46:54,940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ito po yung mga informal or letter complaints.

5216
04:46:57,360 --> 04:47:00,300
ERC Consumer Affairs Service Acting Director Atty. Leila Grace A. San Pedro: Ito po yung mga 629 na clause and termination.

5217
04:47:00,880 --> 04:47:13,040
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung pong kabuuan of the letter complaints that we received for 2026, 629 na po yung aming naisara.

5218
04:47:13,340 --> 04:47:18,580
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ibig sabihin, nagkaroon na ng maayos na usapan o resolusyon yung complaint na yan.

5219
04:47:19,840 --> 04:47:20,780
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung formal complaint.

5220
04:47:21,420 --> 04:47:22,840
ERC Consumer Affairs Service Acting Director Atty. Leila Grace A. San Pedro: It's formal complaint.

5221
04:47:24,080 --> 04:47:26,840
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pero yung pong mga hindi na nagkaayos,

5222
04:47:27,360 --> 04:47:30,260
ERC Consumer Affairs Service Acting Director Atty. Leila Grace A. San Pedro: This one, 2026 po.

5223
04:47:30,880 --> 04:47:31,860
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pagdating po,

5224
04:47:32,000 --> 04:47:32,700
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Combined po yun, sir.

5225
04:47:33,600 --> 04:47:34,160
ERC Consumer Affairs Service Acting Director Atty. Leila Grace A. San Pedro: Combined.

5226
04:47:34,800 --> 04:47:35,520
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ah, sir?

5227
04:47:35,900 --> 04:47:37,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Combined po. 27 lang po.

5228
04:47:38,560 --> 04:47:39,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ong going po natin.

5229
04:47:39,520 --> 04:47:42,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: It's 51, pero combined, insist po, kasi ito siya.

5230
04:47:42,340 --> 04:47:42,480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Oo.

5231
04:47:43,080 --> 04:47:48,360
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Sa mga distribution utilities, lahat na po, ang ongoing lang sa amin ay 51.

5232
04:47:49,020 --> 04:47:49,480
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yes, sir.

5233
04:47:49,600 --> 04:47:53,360
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: 51 po na kaso para sa 2026.

5234
04:47:54,360 --> 04:47:56,940
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Sir, can you submit that data to this committee, please?

5235
04:47:56,940 --> 04:47:57,240
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Apo.

5236
04:47:57,360 --> 04:47:58,220
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: We will submit po.

5237
04:47:58,980 --> 04:47:59,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, Mr. Chair.

5238
04:48:00,020 --> 04:48:02,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I will look forward to the ERC submission on this.

5239
04:48:03,140 --> 04:48:09,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: I'd actually like to ask, sino po yung mga personal natin na in charge dyan?

5240
04:48:09,440 --> 04:48:12,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano ba natin mapapabilis yung disposition ng mga cases?

5241
04:48:13,100 --> 04:48:20,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Paano po natin mapapabilis yung pagsagot dito sa mga issues, concerns, complaints na nailalapit sa atin?

5242
04:48:20,040 --> 04:48:25,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi nababahala po tayo, bagamat meron naman po tayong substantial number na rin ho,

5243
04:48:26,120 --> 04:48:26,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng naisasara.

5244
04:48:27,360 --> 04:48:28,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natutugunan.

5245
04:48:28,220 --> 04:48:36,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero kung meron pang maibibilis, para matiyak po natin, agaran natin din na nasasagot kung ano man yung mga concerns

5246
04:48:36,360 --> 04:48:39,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng ating mga consumers pagdating ho dito.

5247
04:48:39,560 --> 04:48:40,120
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Mr. Chair?

5248
04:48:41,080 --> 04:48:41,640
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Mr. Chair?

5249
04:48:42,920 --> 04:48:44,000
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Hindi nakikinig.

5250
04:48:44,860 --> 04:48:45,680
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Mr. Chair?

5251
04:48:48,180 --> 04:48:49,100
Rep. Marlo C. Bancoro: Yes, ma'am.

5252
04:48:49,420 --> 04:48:49,920
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Mr. Chair?

5253
04:48:50,740 --> 04:48:52,840
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Ipa-plug-in ko lang, Mr. Chair.

5254
04:48:53,880 --> 04:48:54,920
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: ERC actually...

5255
04:48:57,360 --> 04:49:05,580
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: has added tasks and added work because of all the SONA directives, also the complaints,

5256
04:49:05,900 --> 04:49:09,860
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: and with the oil crisis also, dumami talaga.

5257
04:49:10,280 --> 04:49:16,940
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Every year, there are more power plants to regulate, more distributional utilities and electric co-ops to regulate.

5258
04:49:19,440 --> 04:49:25,440
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Unfortunately, their budget request has been cut and hopefully the Congress can address that.

5259
04:49:25,440 --> 04:49:26,280
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So we can...

5260
04:49:26,280 --> 04:49:27,200
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: They can have more...

5261
04:49:27,200 --> 04:49:27,320
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: They can have more...

5262
04:49:27,320 --> 04:49:31,820
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: They can have more personnel and more capacity in order to be faster in their responses.

5263
04:49:32,540 --> 04:49:39,320
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: They're not part of the OE, but they are a regulator, but I think it's about time for them to have a...

5264
04:49:39,320 --> 04:49:44,240
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Medyo dagdag lang ng consultants and people also to help them with this, Mr. Chair.

5265
04:49:44,340 --> 04:49:50,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, sige ho, maisumite na lang ng ERC yung kanilang original proposal for the personal services.

5266
04:49:50,840 --> 04:49:56,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Given the added tasks, syempre gusto naman natin maayos din ho yung compensation, matiyak ho yung...

5267
04:49:57,320 --> 04:50:04,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Karapatan, yung interest din ng lahat ho ng ating mga manggagawa at kapwa lingkod bayan sa pamahalaan.

5268
04:50:04,880 --> 04:50:13,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na sa may napakahalagang gawain na tiyakin na wala hong abuso at wala hong kumbagang lumalagpas sa kung ano lang yung dapat

5269
04:50:13,760 --> 04:50:20,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pagdating sa napakahalaga na utility na niregulate ho ng ERC.

5270
04:50:20,800 --> 04:50:26,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang ngayon naman ho, nais kong magtanong may mechanisms po ba yung ERC para ma-ensure yung...

5271
04:50:27,320 --> 04:50:37,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Implementation ng Meralco refund na matiyak ho natin na kapag may refund ho sila na matitiyak na matanggap ho ng ating mga consumers.

5272
04:50:37,220 --> 04:50:42,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: E hindi naman ho ito maipapasa naman pabalik rin sa mga consumers sa mga susunod na panahon.

5273
04:50:44,540 --> 04:50:54,900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yes po, depending on the nature ng refund na iniimplementa ng Meralco, kung ito ay may kinalaman doon sa...

5274
04:50:54,900 --> 04:50:55,900
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Alimbawa doon sa...

5275
04:50:57,320 --> 04:51:02,640
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Pass-through charge niya, ito ay nire-reflect as a separate item.

5276
04:51:03,080 --> 04:51:18,180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Kung ano yung alimbawa ay refund rate nakatumbas para doon sa over-recovery na yan, ito ay nakareflect yung refund rate na yan at yung corresponding amount.

5277
04:51:18,180 --> 04:51:27,180
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: So makikita rin ito yan sa bill natin and every month, ang Meralco and all other distribution units...

5278
04:51:27,320 --> 04:51:37,140
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Nagsasubmit po sila ng kanilang implementation ng kanilang pass-through charges para nagkakaroon din po ng confirmation.

5279
04:51:38,200 --> 04:51:56,960
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: At malalaman po na natapos na yung refund dahil kailangan po mag-submite ng report ang Meralco sa ERC na yung utos sa kanila na amount na i-refund.

5280
04:51:57,320 --> 04:52:00,620
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Ay natapos na nila, naisoli na nila ng bumbo.

5281
04:52:02,990 --> 04:52:09,110
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Salamat po, Mr. Chair. At yung antabayanan po natin yung submission mula sa ERC tungkol dyan.

5282
04:52:09,110 --> 04:52:27,790
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman sa DOE, November 2022, naglabas ng Department Circular No. 2022-11-0034 na nagpapahintulot sa ating pamahalaan na pumasok sa kontrata with foreign citizens, foreign-owned corporations para mapababa yung gasto sa renewable energy projects.

5283
04:52:27,790 --> 04:52:28,790
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At gawing mas abay.

5284
04:52:28,790 --> 04:52:44,370
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mula po 2022, ilang kontrata nang pinasok ng ating pamahalaan kaugnay ng renewable energy at sino-sino hong mga foreign-owned corporations ang makausap natin dito?

5285
04:52:46,170 --> 04:52:56,710
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Magmula po 2022, nagpas pong isang libong mga kontrata po ang pumasok. Yung mga 100% foreign-owned po, less than 100 po.

5286
04:52:57,050 --> 04:53:00,950
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sir Chair, ganihinga.

5287
04:53:01,030 --> 04:53:11,810
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ganihinga na lang po ng representation na ito, yung listahan, kung sino-sino huya. Alam ko marami. Subukas rin kami soft copy para sa Committee on Appropriations.

5288
04:53:11,950 --> 04:53:18,790
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, nais kong magtanong tungkol sa statements ng ating sekretary tungkol sa Paxilica.

5289
04:53:19,330 --> 04:53:30,550
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi ni Sec. Agarin na ang DOE ay nagdadraft ng circular para maglatag ng guidelines sa paglalagay ng generation capacity para sa data centers at technology hubs.

5290
04:53:30,550 --> 04:53:41,430
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kabilang ng Paxilica. Sinabi niyo rin ho na may several options para matugunan ang power requirement nito mula 50 megawatts, 100 hanggang 5,000.

5291
04:53:42,530 --> 04:53:48,530
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano na po ang status nito? May draft na po ba? At kailan ho ito maasahan na matapos at mailabas?

5292
04:53:48,850 --> 04:53:55,010
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Mr. Chair, it's a data center guideline for energization.

5293
04:53:55,930 --> 04:54:00,070
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Paxilica, they've been repeating na hindi daw sila data center.

5294
04:54:00,550 --> 04:54:03,610
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: We're focusing more on data centers because ito talagang heavy.

5295
04:54:05,490 --> 04:54:15,570
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: We can actually send the draft, pero we are adding more provisions for PESA.

5296
04:54:15,690 --> 04:54:18,930
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So maybe we will finish by the end of the month.

5297
04:54:20,110 --> 04:54:23,790
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: We can send it once it's finished and I can issue it officially already.

5298
04:54:23,950 --> 04:54:24,430
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Thank you, ma'am.

5299
04:54:25,230 --> 04:54:28,590
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi ho ng ating sekretary na may several options.

5300
04:54:29,530 --> 04:54:30,430
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano-ano ho yung mga options?

5301
04:54:30,550 --> 04:54:35,050
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para ma-supply yan ang energy requirement ng mga data centers na ito.

5302
04:54:35,510 --> 04:54:43,890
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa kaso ho ng halimbawa na nabanggit ko sa Paxilica, kung sakali ho na mapipirmahan ho natin yung framework sa darating na November.

5303
04:54:45,710 --> 04:54:49,410
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: It's more than a framework. It's just a guideline. What are the options they have?

5304
04:54:50,930 --> 04:54:56,750
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: For example, halimbawa, they've been saying they need 2 gigawatts or 2,000 megawatts.

5305
04:54:56,750 --> 04:55:00,090
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So, instead of getting it from the grid,

5306
04:55:00,550 --> 04:55:02,990
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: pag ma-destabilize niya,

5307
04:55:03,510 --> 04:55:06,290
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: one option is they can produce it themselves.

5308
04:55:06,830 --> 04:55:08,270
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: They can put up the power plant.

5309
04:55:08,490 --> 04:55:11,690
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Another is they can ask somebody to put it up for them.

5310
04:55:11,690 --> 04:55:21,570
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Or if it's a PESA zone, maybe the economic authority can also do the production of energy and do the distribution and transmission as well.

5311
04:55:22,130 --> 04:55:28,370
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Or they can get a supplier.

5312
04:55:29,230 --> 04:55:30,530
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Halimbawa, i-de-reconnect.

5313
04:55:30,550 --> 04:55:34,430
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Or pwede din na magkontrata siya halimbawa sa isang supplier.

5314
04:55:34,910 --> 04:55:36,930
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Ibig sabihin niya yung supplier, siya yung naghahanap.

5315
04:55:37,310 --> 04:55:39,210
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Tapos nagbebenta lang siya ng power sa kanila.

5316
04:55:39,370 --> 04:55:46,230
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So, it's like GEOP or RES, ARCOA, na siya yung sasabihin niya halimbawa,

5317
04:55:46,370 --> 04:55:51,410
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: one of those retailers, I need 1,000 megawatts of green.

5318
04:55:51,910 --> 04:55:53,190
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Sila yung bahala maghahanap.

5319
04:55:53,190 --> 04:55:59,210
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So, there are several options without risking our consumers.

5320
04:56:00,550 --> 04:56:01,490
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Thank you, Mr.

5321
04:56:02,230 --> 04:56:11,270
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In relation to Paxilica, the Secretary said that several renewable energy projects are scheduled for construction in Central Luzon.

5322
04:56:11,270 --> 04:56:14,130
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, what are these projects, Mr. Chair?

5323
04:56:15,470 --> 04:56:22,450
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Yes, we can send you the list of those that are committed or indicative projects.

5324
04:56:22,870 --> 04:56:24,710
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: But these are not for Paxilica.

5325
04:56:25,350 --> 04:56:30,470
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: This is for the normal needs, the energy mix of the facility.

5326
04:56:30,550 --> 04:56:34,110
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Philippines, without the data center, let's say.

5327
04:56:34,590 --> 04:56:40,690
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: And data center should be treated differently in a sense na dapat hindi niya kinakain yung kailangan ng mga tao.

5328
04:56:42,430 --> 04:56:43,670
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama ko, Mr. Chair.

5329
04:56:44,110 --> 04:56:48,550
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil mahirap kong magsabi na kaya nating supplyan at maraming options,

5330
04:56:48,850 --> 04:56:56,390
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: lalong-lalo na sa panahon ngayon na maraming beses na nagde-declare ng yellow at red alert sa iba't ibang bahagi ng ating bansa.

5331
04:56:56,390 --> 04:57:00,310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya hindi lang nakakabigla, pero nakakabahala.

5332
04:57:00,550 --> 04:57:04,670
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa ganitong mga dambuhalang proyekto, maraming options.

5333
04:57:04,890 --> 04:57:11,310
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero yung para sa mga consumers natin, para sa karaniwang tao, ay kulang na kulang na kulang pa.

5334
04:57:11,570 --> 04:57:22,550
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung mga kinakailangan natin na hindi lang option, pero yung guarantee na meron talaga silang supply ng kuryente.

5335
04:57:22,710 --> 04:57:29,750
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya pagdating sa ganitong mga proyekto, dapat talaga a priority natin yung pangangailangan ng sambayan ng Pilipino.

5336
04:57:29,750 --> 04:57:33,170
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At hindi uunahin yung interest ng dayuhan.

5337
04:57:33,630 --> 04:57:37,470
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bilang panghuli na lang, Mr. Chair, I have a few seconds left.

5338
04:57:38,290 --> 04:57:41,330
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napag-aralan na ho ba ng DOE, ng ERC?

5339
04:57:42,410 --> 04:57:51,530
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kumusta ho yung assessment natin sa implementation ng IPIRA sa 25 years po ng pagpapatupad nito?

5340
04:57:52,930 --> 04:57:56,270
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: I'll give it to Yusek Guevara.

5341
04:57:56,270 --> 04:57:58,050
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: She's written a book about this.

5342
04:57:59,750 --> 04:58:02,570
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: So, I'll let her explain her assessment.

5343
04:58:02,970 --> 04:58:03,870
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

5344
04:58:03,870 --> 04:58:04,830
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Yusek Guevara, you're recognized.

5345
04:58:05,370 --> 04:58:06,210
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

5346
04:58:06,730 --> 04:58:12,950
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Yung pong ating IPIRA journey for the last 25 years, nagkaroon po ng framework.

5347
04:58:13,270 --> 04:58:14,470
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: That is what IPIRA is.

5348
04:58:14,810 --> 04:58:20,750
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Kasi sandamukal na mga policies ang nilabas pa ng DOE, ng ERC, etc.

5349
04:58:21,010 --> 04:58:22,330
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Bago po nabuo lahat.

5350
04:58:22,330 --> 04:58:29,550
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Sa paninaw po namin, yung pangangailangan ng IPIRA at that time, remember in the 90s?

5351
04:58:29,750 --> 04:58:31,530
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Sandamukal ang blackout natin, ano?

5352
04:58:32,190 --> 04:58:33,510
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Nasolve naman yung problem.

5353
04:58:34,370 --> 04:58:36,910
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: But then, nandun naman tayo ngayon sa energy transition.

5354
04:58:37,630 --> 04:58:42,810
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: So, the next 25 years ng IPIRA, kailangan natin i-address yung energy transition.

5355
04:58:43,370 --> 04:58:49,690
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: What is fortunate is that it is the policy of the department because of the renewable energy law

5356
04:58:49,690 --> 04:58:58,350
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: to make sure that we increase our capacity for RE by 2030 to 35%, 50% by 2040.

5357
04:58:58,850 --> 04:58:59,670
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: So, on track.

5358
04:58:59,670 --> 04:58:59,730
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: So, on track.

5359
04:58:59,730 --> 04:59:02,470
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: So, on track po tayo dun sa mga plano natin na ma-achieve.

5360
04:59:02,550 --> 04:59:07,750
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: At nasolve po talaga natin yung mga madami sa problema na ina-attempt ng IPIRA.

5361
04:59:07,850 --> 04:59:09,050
DOE Undersecretary Rowena Cristina L. Guevara: Pero may natitira pa po.

5362
04:59:09,830 --> 04:59:10,130
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes.

5363
04:59:10,690 --> 04:59:15,110
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang pinakamalaking problema dyan, Mr. Chair, yung mahal talaga na singil sa kuryente.

5364
04:59:15,890 --> 04:59:24,210
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sa tingin po namin, very telling na po yung bilang ng complaints pa lang na natatanggap ng ERC pagdating dito.

5365
04:59:24,210 --> 04:59:25,610
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang humahal.

5366
04:59:25,810 --> 04:59:28,210
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Marami pa pong mga concerns pagdating sa...

5367
04:59:28,210 --> 04:59:36,370
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yung kakayahan mismo ng mga kababayan natin na magbayad ng mahal na singil sa kuryente.

5368
04:59:36,510 --> 04:59:43,530
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho, sana ang nasa pipeline ng mga dapat seryosohin ng kongresong ito at dapat suportahan din ng DOE,

5369
04:59:43,970 --> 04:59:49,710
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mga proposals na may kinalaman sa pagtatanggal, halimbawa, ng value-added tax sa kuryente.

5370
04:59:49,710 --> 04:59:53,730
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang po sa system loss, pero pagtatanggal ng VAT sa kuryente.

5371
04:59:54,350 --> 04:59:58,050
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kapag naabot na yung, kung may windfall profits,

5372
04:59:58,210 --> 04:59:59,710
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakuha na natin yung...

5373
05:00:00,000 --> 05:00:05,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung target collection, dapat naman ay magkaroon tayo ng aktibo na mga hakbang

5374
05:00:05,160 --> 05:00:10,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para maging hawan naman at may dagdag ho na relief sa ating mga kababayan

5375
05:00:10,720 --> 05:00:14,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na nakakaranas na rin ngayon ng sobrang-sobrang paghihirap

5376
05:00:14,140 --> 05:00:19,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil sa mahal na singil, hindi lang po sa kuryente, sa pagkain, sa langis.

5377
05:00:19,840 --> 05:00:24,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Marami hong mga binabalikat na mga buwis ang ating mga kababayan

5378
05:00:24,080 --> 05:00:30,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at isang pagtatanggal sa VAT sa mga atiyak na hakbang na maaari hong makatulong sa kanila.

5379
05:00:31,040 --> 05:00:33,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yun lamang sa ngayon. Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

5380
05:00:33,180 --> 05:00:34,220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Sara.

5381
05:00:35,060 --> 05:00:37,340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I totally agree with you.

5382
05:00:37,920 --> 05:00:40,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, Ipira, I think we really have to amend it.

5383
05:00:41,080 --> 05:00:42,540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's been like 25 years.

5384
05:00:43,240 --> 05:00:48,640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, even the penalties, penalties natin, 50 million, ano ba yung 50 million yan,

5385
05:00:49,180 --> 05:00:50,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: increase it to 500 million.

5386
05:00:51,380 --> 05:00:53,580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, there's so many things that we need to do

5387
05:00:53,580 --> 05:00:54,920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: para sa power industry.

5388
05:00:55,040 --> 05:00:58,240
DOE Secretary Sharon S. Garin: Well, Mr. Chair, we'll work with Chairman Alvarez and...

