ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Oo po, Mr. Chair, we will welcome that choice of venue,

5523
05:08:18,610 --> 05:08:19,790
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Cagayan di Oro

5524
