ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: dahil,

5525
05:08:20,170 --> 05:08:22,110
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: I am also an

5526
05:08:22,430 --> 05:08:24,470
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: unadapted son

