5552
05:10:57,010 --> 05:11:05,310
ERC Chairperson and CEO Francis Saturnino C. Juan: Yung pong pagkakaroon ng hearing, napapabiyayihin natin yung ating staff from Mindanao, from Davao to kagandi-oro.

