6022
05:39:14,960 --> 05:39:18,740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: From the good news to a not so good news.

6023
05:39:19,420 --> 05:39:25,540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Of course, I have to perform my job, provide check and balance.

