Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yung nakatapat.

6054
05:41:01,550 --> 05:41:02,390
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ang technical lang.

6055
05:41:02,510 --> 05:41:06,330
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Huwag na natin pag-usapan yung technical systems loss.

6056
